      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are ways to do this using synced bools and unsynched ints (so input is an int, synced parameter is multiple bools), but that requires converting the int value to the bool values and back for remote players to see the parameter change.. very annoying. This feature would be much nicer",
